{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27121","headline":"秋晚归庐山留别道友 · 周贺","name":"秋晚归庐山留别道友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病起陵阳思翠微，秋风动後着行衣。\n月生石齿人同见，霜落木梢愁独归。\n已许衲僧修静社，便将樵叟对闲扉。\n不嫌旧隐相随去，庐岳临天好息机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27121.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27121","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}